    "Remove paired device?": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "解除与此设备的配对？"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "解除與此裝置的配對？"}}}},
    "Remove relay credential?": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "移除中继凭据？"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "移除中繼憑證？"}}}},
    "Delete clipboard item?": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "删除这条剪贴板记录？"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "刪除這筆剪貼簿記錄？"}}}},
    "No paired devices": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "没有已配对的设备"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "沒有已配對的裝置"}}}},
    "Setup guide": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "使用指引"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "使用指引"}}}},
    "Later": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "稍后设置"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "稍後設定"}}}},
    "Add the ClipRelay keyboard": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "添加随贴键盘"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "加入隨貼鍵盤"}}}},
    "Keyboard detected": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "已检测到随贴键盘"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "已偵測到隨貼鍵盤"}}}},
    "Settings → General → Keyboard → Keyboards → Add New Keyboard → ClipRelay": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "设置 → 通用 → 键盘 → 键盘 → 添加新键盘 → 随贴"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "設定 → 一般 → 鍵盤 → 鍵盤 → 新增鍵盤 → 隨貼"}}}},
    "Allow Full Access": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "允许完全访问"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "允許完整取用"}}}},
    "In the Keyboards list, tap ClipRelay, turn on Allow Full Access, then tap Allow.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "在键盘列表中点「随贴」，打开「允许完全访问」，再点「允许」。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "在鍵盤列表中點一下「隨貼」，開啟「允許完整取用」，再點一下「允許」。"}}}},
    "Full Access lets the keyboard open your shared clipboard history and saved phrases. Basic typing works without it.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "开启后，键盘可以使用随贴的剪贴板历史和常用语。关闭时仍可打字。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "開啟後，鍵盤可以使用隨貼的剪貼簿記錄和常用語。關閉時仍可打字。"}}}},
    "Open system settings": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "打开系统设置"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "打開系統設定"}}}},
    "Check your keyboard": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "检查键盘设置"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "檢查鍵盤設定"}}}},
    "Tap to test the keyboard": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "点此测试键盘"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "點一下測試鍵盤"}}}},
    "Return here, tap the test field, then hold the globe key and choose ClipRelay. The check runs automatically.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "返回后，点测试框，长按地球键并选择「随贴」。切换后会自动检查。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "返回後，點一下測試欄，按住地球鍵並選擇「隨貼」。切換後會自動檢查。"}}}},
    "Retry keyboard check": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "重新检查键盘"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "重新檢查鍵盤"}}}},
    "Full Access is still off. Turn it on in Settings, then test again.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "完全访问仍未开启。请在设置中打开后再检查。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "完整取用仍未開啟。請在設定中開啟後再檢查。"}}}},
    "Keyboard preferences": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "键盘偏好"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "鍵盤偏好"}}}},
    "Keyboard and Full Access verified": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "键盘和完全访问均已验证"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "鍵盤和完整取用均已驗證"}}}},
    "Keyboard opens to": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "键盘启动页"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "鍵盤啟動頁"}}}},
    "Typing": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "打字"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "打字"}}}},
    "Default input mode": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "默认输入方式"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "預設輸入方式"}}}},
    "English": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "英文"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "英文"}}}},
    "Chinese Pinyin": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "中文拼音"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "中文拼音"}}}},
    "Continue to Mac pairing": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "继续配对 Mac"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "繼續配對 Mac"}}}},
    "Pair with your Mac": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "与 Mac 配对"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "與 Mac 配對"}}}},
    "Pair later": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "稍后配对"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "稍後配對"}}}},
    "On your Mac, open ClipRelay → Devices → Show pairing code. Keep both devices on the same Wi-Fi.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "在 Mac 上打开「随贴 → 设备 → 显示配对码」，并把两台设备连接到同一个 Wi-Fi。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "在 Mac 上打開「隨貼 → 裝置 → 顯示配對碼」，並將兩部裝置連接到同一個 Wi-Fi。"}}}},
    "Allow Local Network in Settings to pair over Wi-Fi.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "在系统设置中允许随贴访问本地网络，即可通过 Wi-Fi 配对。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "在系統設定中允許隨貼取用區域網路，即可透過 Wi-Fi 配對。"}}}},
    "Show pairing code": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "显示配对码"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "顯示配對碼"}}}},
    "6-digit pairing code": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "6 位配对码"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "6 位配對碼"}}}},
    "Pair": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "配对"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "配對"}}}},
    "Pairing QR code": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "配对二维码"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "配對 QR 碼"}}}},
    "Scan pairing QR code": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "扫描配对二维码"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "掃描配對 QR 碼"}}}},
    "Nearby devices": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "附近的设备"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "附近的裝置"}}}},
    "Copy pairing code": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "复制配对码"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "複製配對碼"}}}},
    "Copy full invitation code": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "复制完整邀请码"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "複製完整邀請碼"}}}},
    "Full pairing code": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "完整配对码"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "完整配對碼"}}}},
    "Copy full pairing code": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "复制完整配对码"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "複製完整配對碼"}}}},
    "Local address (optional)": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "局域网地址（选填）"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "區域網路位址（選填）"}}}},
    "Enter a local IP address and port, such as 192.168.1.2:52000.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "请输入局域网 IP 和端口，例如 192.168.1.2:52000。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "請輸入區域網路 IP 和連接埠，例如 192.168.1.2:52000。"}}}},
    "No matching pairing code. Check the code and Wi-Fi, or scan the pairing QR code.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "未找到匹配的配对码。请检查配对码和 Wi-Fi，或扫描配对二维码。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "找不到相符的配對碼。請檢查配對碼和 Wi-Fi，或掃描配對 QR 碼。"}}}},
    "Excluded apps": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "排除的应用"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "排除的應用程式"}}}},
    "Add apps…": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "添加应用…"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "加入應用程式…"}}}},
    "Remove %@ from excluded apps": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "从排除列表移除 %@"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "從排除清單移除 %@"}}}},
